sequenceDiagram
    participant Sender
    participant Backend as local backend send path
    participant DB as peer_messages / peer_message_notifications
    participant RecipientBrowser as Recipient's browser (signed out)
    participant Recipient

    Sender->>Backend: sends message (allow verdict)
    Backend->>DB: insert peer_messages + peer_message_notifications(read_at=null) for recipient
    Note over RecipientBrowser: Recipient is signed out — no realtime subscription,<br/>no OS push notification is promised.
    Recipient->>RecipientBrowser: signs in later
    RecipientBrowser->>DB: fetchUnreadCount() / fetchConversations()
    DB-->>RecipientBrowser: unread notification rows still present
    RecipientBrowser-->>Recipient: conversation shown with unread badge
